{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is detected, move to object, grab, process object, and move to destination. If not, scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ProcessObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />\"",
